OL,3,GNEWSAPortrait of George Mitchell will
OL,4,Anot be removed from Hillsborough Castle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA portrait of former US Senator George
OL,7,FMitchell on display at Hillsborough
OL,8,FCastle, Northern Ireland's official
OL,9,Fresidence of the Royal family, will
OL,10,Fremain in place as part of the castle's
OL,11,F"important story" in the peace process.
OL,13,FThe former US envoy played a key role
OL,14,Fin the 1998 Good Friday Agreement,
OL,15,Fwhich ended decades of violence in
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,18,FIn 2026, a number of institutions had
OL,19,Fsevered ties with George Mitchell over
OL,20,Fhis links with convicted sex offender
OL,21,FJeffrey Epstein.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
