OL,3,GNEWSAPortrait of George Mitchell will
OL,4,Anot be removed from Hillsborough Castle
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt followed the release of millions of
OL,7,Ffiles relating to Epstein by the US
OL,8,FDepartment of Justice, including
OL,9,Ffurther references to an earlier claim
OL,10,FGeorge Mitchell had sex with Epstein
OL,11,Fvictim, Virginia Giuffre.
